{"type":"message","id":"fb61e27d","parentId":"7d0bfb31","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:29.430Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-02-27 08:38 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 请继续优化 fsrs-memory 项目。\n\n## 本次优化目标（3个）\n\n### 1. 完整 FSRS 算法\n- 当前使用的是简化版算法\n- 需要引入官方 fsrs.js 库：https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js\n- 确保与现有数据结构兼容\n\n### 2. 多牌组管理\n- 支持创建多个牌组（deck）\n- 每个牌组独立管理自己的卡片\n- 牌组可以设置不同的学习参数\n\n### 3. 主题切换\n- 支持亮色/暗色主题切换\n- 主题设置持久化保存\n\n## 技术要求\n- 使用 DAG 模式组织任务\n- 确保与现有数据兼容（可能需要数据迁移）\n- 保持 Web UI 和 Discord 服务正常运行\n\n## 文件位置\n- Web UI: /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/\n- Discord 服务: /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/service.js\n- 数据: /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/data/cards.db\n\n请按需拉取 code-agent、test-agent、review-agent 等成员来完成这些优化。"}],"timestamp":1772152709427}}
{"type":"message","id":"7b901e84","parentId":"fb61e27d","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:40.363Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我需要作为 leader-agent 来协调 fsrs-memory 项目的优化工作。让我先分析任务：\n\n1. **完整 FSRS 算法** - 需要引入官方 fsrs.js 库\n2. **多牌组管理** - 支持多个牌组\n3. **主题切换** - 亮色/暗色主题\n\n首先，我需要了解项目的当前状态，然后组织 DAG 模式的任务分配。\n\n让我先查看项目结构和现有代码。","thinkingSignature":"e8d14243bb6bf0447a60418f1dc675afcc63274d625a5e23ae1069b773969ae0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xrct7any04ta_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory -type f -name \"*.js\" -o -name \"*.html\" -o -name \"*.json\" 2>/dev/null | head -30"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xrct7any04ta_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":4,"output":198,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":9405,"totalTokens":9607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772152709429}}
