{"type":"message","id":"7b0f1380","parentId":"560d45df","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:43.679Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我查看现有的核心文件，了解当前的实现状态。","thinkingSignature":"8187d9db846fc428eaa2f548d30620c4fc0abb0dfb133e2ff90037d14e34143b"},{"type":"text","text":"让我查看现有的核心文件：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1z29584do90y_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/package.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1z29584do90y_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/service.js"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1z29584do90y_3","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":1530,"output":127,"cacheRead":9100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772152720409}}
{"type":"message","id":"acc90bc8","parentId":"7b0f1380","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:43.707Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1z29584do90y_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"fsrs-memory\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"当用户在 Discord 发送消息时，使用以下 handler 处理：\",\n  \"main\": \"index.js\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"echo \\\"Error: no test specified\\\" && exit 1\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [],\n  \"author\": \"\",\n  \"license\": \"ISC\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"better-sqlite3\": \"^12.6.2\",\n    \"fsrs.js\": \"^1.2.2\",\n    \"https-proxy-agent\": \"^7.0.6\"\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152723705}}
{"type":"message","id":"1aa756ed","parentId":"acc90bc8","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:43.713Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1z29584do90y_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env node\n// service.js - FSRS Memory Service Daemon (Real-time Version)\n// 检测到期卡片并通过 Discord Webhook 立即发送提醒\n\nconst path = require('path');\nconst https = require('https');\nconst http = require('http');\n\n// Proxy agent support\nconst { HttpsProxyAgent } = require('https-proxy-agent');\n\nconst SKILL_ROOT = path.join(__dirname);\n\n// Load FSRS modules\nconst Storage = require(path.join(SKILL_ROOT, 'src', 'storage'));\nconst Scheduler = require(path.join(SKILL_ROOT, 'src', 'scheduler'));\n\n// Configuration\nconst CONFIG = {\n  // Discord Webhook URL (设置环境变量或在这里硬编码)\n  webhookUrl: process.env.DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL || 'https://discord.com/api/webhooks/1476549088957698079/CC-uWkcYBSErbORMpypg8HnKpZIGdq5xf1NbA8hISKSDxl-sJ_W_yRjZB5CYGgl_C-zT',\n  // 检查间隔（毫秒）- 默认 30 秒，实现真正的实时检测\n  checkInterval: parseInt(process.env.CHECK_INTERVAL) || 30 * 1000,\n  // 频道 ID（用于日志）\n  channelId: process.env.DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID || '1475710747114737717',\n  // 同一卡片提醒冷却时间（毫秒）- 默认 2 小时\n  cooldownMs: parseInt(process.env.REMINDER_COOLDOWN) || 2 * 60 * 60 * 1000,\n  // 是否启用详细日志\n  verbose: process.env.VERBOSE === 'true'\n};\n\n// State file for tracking sent reminders\nconst STATE_FILE = path.join(SKILL_ROOT, 'data', 'reminder-state.json');\n\n// Load reminder state\nfunction loadState() {\n  try {\n    const fs = require('fs');\n    if (fs.existsSync(STATE_FILE)) {\n      return JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(STATE_FILE, 'utf8'));\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.error('[Error] Failed to load state:', e.message);\n  }\n  return { sent: {}, cooldownList: [] };\n}\n\n// Save reminder state\nfunction saveState(state) {\n  const fs = require('fs');\n  const dataDir = path.join(SKILL_ROOT, 'data');\n  if (!fs.existsSync(dataDir)) {\n    fs.mkdirSync(dataDir, { recursive: true });\n  }\n  fs.writeFileSync(STATE_FILE, JSON.stringify(state, null, 2));\n}\n\n// Send Discord message via Webhook\nfunction sendDiscordMessage(message) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const url = new URL(CONFIG.webhookUrl);\n    \n    const data = JSON.stringify({\n      content: message,\n      username: 'FSRS 复习助手',\n      avatar_url: 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png'\n    });\n    \n    const options = {\n      hostname: url.hostname,\n      port: 443,\n      path: url.pathname,\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n        'Content-Length': Buffer.byteLength(data)\n      },\n      agent: new HttpsProxyAgent(process.env.HTTPS_PROXY || process.env.http_proxy || process.env.ALL_PROXY)\n    };\n    \n    const req = https.request(options, (res) => {\n      let body = '';\n      res.on('data', chunk => body += chunk);\n      res.on('end', () => {\n        if (res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 300) {\n          resolve(body);\n        } else {\n          reject(new Error(`HTTP ${res.statusCode}: ${body}`));\n        }\n      });\n    });\n    \n    req.on('error', reject);\n    req.write(data);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}\n\n// Check if reminder should be sent (cooldown check)\nfunction shouldRemind(cardId, state) {\n  const now = Date.now();\n  \n  // Check if in cooldown list\n  const cooldownEntry = state.cooldownList.find(c => c.cardId === cardId);\n  if (cooldownEntry) {\n    if (now - cooldownEntry.sentAt < CONFIG.cooldownMs) {\n      // Still in cooldown\n      return false;\n    } else {\n      // Cooldown expired, remove from list\n      state.cooldownList = state.cooldownList.filter(c => c.cardId !== cardId);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // Check if already sent recently (backward compatibility)\n  if (state.sent[cardId]) {\n    const sentAt = state.sent[cardId];\n    if (now - sentAt < CONFIG.cooldownMs) {\n      return false;\n    }\n    // Clean up old entry\n    delete state.sent[cardId];\n  }\n  \n  return true;\n}\n\n// Mark reminder as sent\nfunction markReminded(cardId, state) {\n  const now = Date.now();\n  \n  // Add to cooldown list\n  state.cooldownList.push({\n    cardId: cardId,\n    sentAt: now\n  });\n  \n  // Also keep in old format for backward compatibility\n  state.sent[cardId] = now;\n  \n  // Clean up old cooldown entries (older than 25 hours)\n  const cutoff = now - (CONFIG.cooldownMs + 60 * 60 * 1000);\n  state.cooldownList = state.cooldownList.filter(c => c.sentAt > cutoff);\n  \n  saveState(state);\n}\n\n// Check and send reminders for due cards\nasync function checkAndSendReminders() {\n  const state = loadState();\n  const dueInfo = Scheduler.checkDueCards();\n  \n  if (dueInfo.count === 0) {\n    if (CONFIG.verbose) {\n      console.log(`[${new Date().toISOString()}] No due cards.`);\n    }\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  console.log(`[${new Date().toISOString()}] Found ${dueInfo.count} due cards`);\n  \n  let sentCount = 0;\n  \n  for (const card of dueInfo.cards) {\n    // Check cooldown\n    if (!shouldRemind(card.id, state)) {\n      if (CONFIG.verbose) {\n        console.log(`[Card #${card.id}] Skipped (in cooldown)`);\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n    \n    // Build reminder message\n    const message = `🔔 **FSRS 复习提醒**\\n\\n` +\n      `📝 **卡片 #${card.id}**\\n\\n` +\n      `**问题:** ${card.question}\\n\\n` +\n      `💡 回复 \"复习\" 开始回忆！\\n` +\n      `━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━`;\n    \n    try {\n      await sendDiscordMessage(message);\n      markReminded(card.id, state);\n      sentCount++;\n      console.log(`[${new Date().toISOString()}] ✅ Sent reminder for card #${card.id}: \"${card.question.substring(0, 30)}...\"`);\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error(`[${new Date().toISOString()}] ❌ Failed to send reminder for card #${card.id}:`, e.message);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  if (sentCount > 0) {\n    console.log(`[${new Date().toISOString()}] 📤 Sent ${sentCount} reminder(s)`);\n  }\n}\n\n// Check webhook URL configuration\nfunction checkConfig() {\n  if (CONFIG.webhookUrl.includes('your-webhook-here')) {\n    console.log('');\n    console.log('⚠️  WARNING: Discord Webhook URL not configured!');\n    console.log('⚠️  Please set DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL environment variable:');\n    console.log('');\n    console.log('   export DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=\"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...\"');\n    console.log('');\n    console.log('   To create a webhook:');\n    console.log('   1. Server Settings → Integrations → Webhooks');\n    console.log('   2. Create Webhook → Copy URL');\n    console.log('');\n    return false;\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n\n// Health check endpoint (optional)\nfunction startHealthCheckServer() {\n  if (!process.env.ENABLE_HEALTH_CHECK) return;\n  \n  const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {\n    if (req.url === '/health') {\n      const dueInfo = Scheduler.checkDueCards();\n      res.writeHead(200, { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' });\n      res.end(JSON.stringify({\n        status: 'ok',\n        dueCards: dueInfo.count,\n        timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n      }));\n    } else {\n      res.writeHead(404);\n      res.end();\n    }\n  });\n  \n  const port = parseInt(process.env.HEALTH_CHECK_PORT) || 3000;\n  server.listen(port, () => {\n    console.log(`[Health] Server running on port ${port}`);\n  });\n}\n\n// Main\nconsole.log('===================================================');\nconsole.log('   FSRS Memory Service Daemon (Real-time Mode)');\nconsole.log('===================================================');\nconsole.log(`📅 Started at: ${new Date().toISOString()}`);\nconsole.log(`⏱️  Check Interval: ${CONFIG.checkInterval / 1000} seconds`);\nconsole.log(`🔔 Cooldown: ${CONFIG.cooldownMs / (60 * 60 * 1000)} hours`);\nconsole.log(`📁 State File: ${STATE_FILE}`);\nconsole.log('===================================================');\n\n// Check configuration\nconst configOk = checkConfig();\nif (!configOk) {\n  console.log('⚠️  Running in demo mode (no messages will be sent)');\n  console.log('');\n}\n\n// Start health check server if enabled\nstartHealthCheckServer();\n\n// Initial check\nsetTimeout(checkAndSendReminders, 1000);\n\n// Periodic check - using tighter interval for real-time\nsetInterval(checkAndSendReminders, CONFIG.checkInterval);\n\n// Export for testing\nmodule.exports = {\n  checkAndSendReminders,\n  CONFIG,\n  loadState,\n  saveState\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152723711}}
{"type":"message","id":"5d31c251","parentId":"1aa756ed","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:43.719Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1z29584do90y_3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// FSRS Memory Web UI - Application Logic\n\nconst API_BASE = window.location.origin;\n\n// State\nlet currentView = 'study';\nlet dueCards = [];\nlet allCards = [];\nlet currentCardIndex = 0;\nlet currentCard = null;\nlet isAnswerShown = false;\n\n// ==================== Initialization ====================\n\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  initNavigation();\n  initKeyboardShortcuts();\n  loadStats();\n  loadDueCards();\n});\n\n// ==================== Navigation ====================\n\nfunction initNavigation() {\n  const navItems = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item');\n  navItems.forEach(item => {\n    item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const view = item.dataset.view;\n      showView(view);\n    });\n  });\n}\n\nfunction showView(view) {\n  // Update nav\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(item => {\n    item.classList.toggle('active', item.dataset.view === view);\n  });\n  \n  // Update view\n  document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(v => {\n    v.classList.toggle('active', v.id === `${view}-view`);\n  });\n  \n  currentView = view;\n  \n  // Load data for specific views\n  if (view === 'study') {\n    loadDueCards();\n  } else if (view === 'cards') {\n    loadAllCards();\n  } else if (view === 'stats') {\n    loadStats();\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Keyboard Shortcuts ====================\n\nfunction initKeyboardShortcuts() {\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    // Don't trigger shortcuts when typing in inputs\n    if (e.target.tagName === 'INPUT' || e.target.tagName === 'TEXTAREA') {\n      return;\n    }\n    \n    // Study view shortcuts\n    if (currentView === 'study' && dueCards.length > 0) {\n      if (!isAnswerShown) {\n        // Space or Enter to show answer\n        if (e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'Enter') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          showAnswer();\n        }\n      } else {\n        // Number keys 1-5 for rating\n        if (e.key >= '1' && e.key <= '5') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          rateCard(parseInt(e.key));\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // Navigation shortcuts\n    if (e.altKey) {\n      switch(e.key) {\n        case '1':\n          showView('study');\n          break;\n        case '2':\n          showView('cards');\n          break;\n        case '3':\n          showView('add');\n          break;\n        case '4':\n          showView('stats');\n          break;\n      }\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// ==================== Study View ====================\n\nasync function loadDueCards() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards/due`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      dueCards = result.data;\n      currentCardIndex = 0;\n      isAnswerShown = false;\n      updateStudyProgress();\n      \n      if (dueCards.length > 0) {\n        showCard();\n      } else {\n        showEmptyState();\n      }\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load due cards:', error);\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction updateStudyProgress() {\n  const studied = currentCardIndex;\n  const total = dueCards.length;\n  document.getElementById('study-progress').textContent = `${studied} / ${total}`;\n  document.getElementById('due-badge').textContent = total;\n}\n\nfunction showCard() {\n  isAnswerShown = false;\n  \n  const emptyState = document.getElementById('no-cards-message');\n  const cardArea = document.getElementById('card-area');\n  \n  emptyState.style.display = 'none';\n  cardArea.style.display = 'flex';\n  cardArea.style.flexDirection = 'column';\n  cardArea.style.alignItems = 'center';\n  \n  currentCard = dueCards[currentCardIndex];\n  \n  // Reset card display with animation\n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\n  \n  cardFront.style.display = 'block';\n  cardFront.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\n  cardBack.style.display = 'none';\n  \n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'inline-block';\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'none';\n  \n  // Set card content\n  document.getElementById('card-id').textContent = currentCard.id;\n  document.getElementById('card-state').textContent = currentCard.state;\n  document.getElementById('card-state').className = `card-state ${currentCard.state}`;\n  document.getElementById('question-text').textContent = currentCard.question;\n  document.getElementById('answer-text').textContent = currentCard.answer;\n  \n  // Update intervals preview\n  updateIntervalPreview();\n  \n  // Focus the show answer button for accessibility\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').focus();\n}\n\nfunction showAnswer() {\n  isAnswerShown = true;\n  \n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\n  \n  cardFront.style.display = 'none';\n  cardBack.style.display = 'flex';\n  cardBack.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\n  \n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'none';\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'flex';\n  \n  // Focus first rating button\n  document.querySelector('.rating-btn').focus();\n}\n\nfunction updateIntervalPreview() {\n  // Calculate interval previews based on current card state\n  const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\n  \n  document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\n  document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\n  document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\n  document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\n  document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\n}\n\nfunction calculateIntervals(card) {\n  let { interval, ease_factor, repetitions } = card;\n  ease_factor = ease_factor || 2.5;\n  interval = interval || 0;\n  \n  return [\n    '1m',  // Again\n    Math.max(1, Math.round(interval * 1.2)) + 'm',  // Hard\n    repetitions === 0 ? '1d' : (repetitions === 1 ? '6d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor) + 'd'),  // Good\n    repetitions === 0 ? '4d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.3) + 'd',  // Easy\n    repetitions === 0 ? '10d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.5) + 'd'  // Perfect\n  ];\n}\n\nasync function rateCard(rating) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}`, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ rating })\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      currentCardIndex++;\n      updateStudyProgress();\n      \n      if (currentCardIndex < dueCards.length) {\n        showCard();\n      } else {\n        // All cards reviewed\n        showCompleteState();\n      }\n      \n      // Update stats in background\n      loadStats();\n      \n      // Show toast with next interval\n      const ratingNames = ['Again', 'Hard', 'Good', 'Easy', 'Perfect'];\n      showToast(`已评分: ${ratingNames[rating-1]} - 下次复习: ${result.data.nextInterval}天`, 'success');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to rate card:', error);\n    showToast('评分失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction showEmptyState() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\n  container.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"no-cards-message\">\n      <div class=\"empty-icon\">🎉</div>\n      <h2>太棒了！</h2>\n      <p>今天没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">添加新卡片</button>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nfunction showCompleteState() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\n  container.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"empty-state\">\n      <div class=\"empty-icon\">🏆</div>\n      <h2>完成！</h2>\n      <p>恭喜完成今日复习</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('stats')\">查看统计</button>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ==================== Cards List ====================\n\nasync function loadAllCards() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      allCards = result.data;\n      renderCardsList();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load cards:', error);\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderCardsList() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('cards-list');\n  const searchTerm = document.getElementById('card-search').value.toLowerCase();\n  \n  const filteredCards = allCards.filter(card => \n    card.question.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm) ||\n    card.answer.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm)\n  );\n  \n  if (filteredCards.length === 0) {\n    container.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"empty-state\">\n        <div class=\"empty-icon\">📭</div>\n        <h2>没有找到卡片</h2>\n        <p>${searchTerm ? '尝试其他搜索词' : '添加你的第一张卡片吧'}</p>\n      </div>\n    `;\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  container.innerHTML = filteredCards.map(card => `\n    <div class=\"card-item\" data-id=\"${card.id}\">\n      <div class=\"card-item-content\">\n        <div class=\"card-item-header\">\n          <span class=\"card-item-id\">#${card.id}</span>\n          <span class=\"card-item-state card-state ${card.state}\">${card.state}</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-item-question\">${escapeHtml(card.question)}</div>\n        <div class=\"card-item-answer\">${escapeHtml(card.answer)}</div>\n        <div class=\"card-item-meta\">\n          <span>间隔: ${card.interval || 0}天</span>\n          <span>复习: ${card.repetitions || 0}次</span>\n          <span>难度: ${(card.ease_factor || 2.5).toFixed(2)}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-item-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn-icon\" onclick=\"editCard(${card.id})\" title=\"编辑\">✏️</button>\n        <button class=\"btn-icon danger\" onclick=\"confirmDelete(${card.id})\" title=\"删除\">🗑️</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `).join('');\n}\n\nfunction filterCards() {\n  renderCardsList();\n}\n\nfunction escapeHtml(text) {\n  const div = document.createElement('div');\n  div.textContent = text;\n  return div.innerHTML;\n}\n\n// ==================== Add Card ====================\n\nasync function addCard() {\n  const question = document.getElementById('question-input').value.trim();\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer-input').value.trim();\n  \n  if (!question || !answer) {\n    showToast('请填写问题和答案', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  // Basic validation\n  if (question.length > 1000 || answer.length > 5000) {\n    showToast('输入内容过长', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ question, answer })\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('卡片添加成功', 'success');\n      document.getElementById('question-input').value = '';\n      document.getElementById('answer-input').value = '';\n      loadStats();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\n    showToast('添加失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function quickAdd() {\n  const input = document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value.trim();\n  if (!input) {\n    showToast('请输入卡片内容', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  const lines = input.split('\\n').filter(line => line.includes('::'));\n  if (lines.length === 0) {\n    showToast('格式错误，请使用 \"问题::答案\" 格式', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  let successCount = 0;\n  \n  for (const line of lines) {\n    const [question, answer] = line.split('::').map(s => s.trim());\n    if (question && answer) {\n      try {\n        await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n          body: JSON.stringify({ question, answer })\n        });\n        successCount++;\n      } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  \n  showToast(`成功添加 ${successCount} 张卡片`, 'success');\n  document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value = '';\n  loadStats();\n}\n\n// ==================== Stats ====================\n\nasync function loadStats() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/stats`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      const stats = result.data;\n      \n      // Update sidebar stats\n      document.getElementById('total-cards').textContent = stats.total;\n      document.getElementById('due-cards').textContent = stats.due;\n      \n      // Update stats view\n      document.getElementById('stat-total').textContent = stats.total;\n      document.getElementById('stat-due').textContent = stats.due;\n      document.getElementById('stat-reviewed').textContent = stats.reviewed;\n      document.getElementById('stat-new').textContent = stats.new;\n      document.getElementById('stat-learning').textContent = stats.learning;\n      document.getElementById('stat-ease').textContent = stats.avgEase;\n      \n      // Update progress bar\n      const total = stats.total || 1;\n      const newPercent = (stats.new / total) * 100;\n      const learningPercent = (stats.learning / total) * 100;\n      const reviewPercent = (stats.review / total) * 100;\n      \n      document.getElementById('progress-new').style.width = `${newPercent}%`;\n      document.getElementById('progress-learning').style.width = `${learningPercent}%`;\n      document.getElementById('progress-review').style.width = `${reviewPercent}%`;\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load stats:', error);\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Delete Card ====================\n\nfunction confirmDelete(cardId) {\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'flex';\n  document.getElementById('confirm-delete-btn').onclick = () => deleteCard(cardId);\n}\n\nfunction closeModal() {\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'none';\n}\n\nasync function deleteCard(cardId) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards/${cardId}`, {\n      method: 'DELETE'\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('卡片已删除', 'success');\n      closeModal();\n      loadAllCards();\n      loadStats();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to delete card:', error);\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Edit Card ====================\n\nasync function editCard(cardId) {\n  const card = allCards.find(c => c.id === cardId);\n  if (!card) return;\n  \n  // Fill the add form with card data\n  document.getElementById('question-input').value = card.question;\n  document.getElementById('answer-input').value = card.answer;\n  \n  // Delete the old card\n  await deleteCard(cardId);\n  \n  // Switch to add view\n  showView('add');\n  showToast('已复制到编辑区，请修改后重新添加', 'success');\n}\n\n// ==================== Toast ====================\n\nfunction showToast(message, type = 'success') {\n  const toast = document.getElementById('toast');\n  toast.textContent = message;\n  toast.className = `toast ${type} show`;\n  \n  setTimeout(() => {\n    toast.classList.remove('show');\n  }, 3000);\n}\n\n// Make functions available globally\nwindow.showView = showView;\nwindow.showAnswer = showAnswer;\nwindow.rateCard = rateCard;\nwindow.addCard = addCard;\nwindow.quickAdd = quickAdd;\nwindow.filterCards = filterCards;\nwindow.confirmDelete = confirmDelete;\nwindow.closeModal = closeModal;\nwindow.deleteCard = deleteCard;\nwindow.editCard = editCard;\nwindow.showToast = showToast;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152723717}}
{"type":"message","id":"30d998ce","parentId":"5d31c251","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:48.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我继续查看更多相关文件，了解当前的存储和调度器实现。","thinkingSignature":"a3f467fda36b3d688844029be537928d23810df3c8c7be2f72382f0e9f397134"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7igerq8tiaxy_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7igerq8tiaxy_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src/storage.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":7798,"output":92,"cacheRead":9100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16990,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772152723719}}
{"type":"message","id":"f839164c","parentId":"30d998ce","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:48.343Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7igerq8tiaxy_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 20\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Feb 26 19:30 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 one one 4096 Feb 26 22:58 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2798 Feb 26 19:35 fsrs.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2175 Feb 26 19:30 scheduler.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 3017 Feb 26 19:30 storage.js"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6,"aggregated":"total 20\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Feb 26 19:30 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 one one 4096 Feb 26 22:58 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2798 Feb 26 19:35 fsrs.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2175 Feb 26 19:30 scheduler.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 3017 Feb 26 19:30 storage.js","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152728341}}
{"type":"message","id":"601d7f3e","parentId":"f839164c","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:48.350Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7igerq8tiaxy_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// storage.js - SQLite based storage for FSRS cards\nconst Database = require('better-sqlite3');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst fs = require('fs');\n\nconst DATA_DIR = path.join(__dirname, '..', 'data');\nconst DB_PATH = path.join(DATA_DIR, 'cards.db');\n\n// Ensure data directory exists\nif (!fs.existsSync(DATA_DIR)) {\n  fs.mkdirSync(DATA_DIR, { recursive: true });\n}\n\n// Initialize database\nconst db = new Database(DB_PATH);\n\n// Create tables\ndb.exec(`\n  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS cards (\n    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n    question TEXT NOT NULL,\n    answer TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n    due_date DATETIME,\n    interval INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n    ease_factor REAL DEFAULT 2.5,\n    repetitions INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n    lapses INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n    state TEXT DEFAULT 'new',\n    last_review DATETIME\n  );\n  \n  CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_due_date ON cards(due_date);\n`);\n\n// Storage operations\nconst Storage = {\n  // Add a new card\n  addCard(question, answer) {\n    const now = new Date();\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      INSERT INTO cards (question, answer, due_date, created_at)\n      VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)\n    `);\n    const result = stmt.run(question, answer, now.toISOString(), now.toISOString());\n    return result.lastInsertRowid;\n  },\n  \n  // Get all cards\n  getAllCards() {\n    const stmt = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards ORDER BY created_at DESC');\n    return stmt.all();\n  },\n  \n  // Get card by ID\n  getCard(id) {\n    const stmt = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?');\n    return stmt.get(id);\n  },\n  \n  // Get due cards\n  getDueCards() {\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      SELECT * FROM cards \n      WHERE due_date <= ? \n      ORDER BY due_date ASC\n    `);\n    return stmt.all(now);\n  },\n  \n  // Update card after review\n  updateCard(id, data) {\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      UPDATE cards SET\n        due_date = ?,\n        interval = ?,\n        ease_factor = ?,\n        repetitions = ?,\n        lapses = ?,\n        state = ?,\n        last_review = ?\n      WHERE id = ?\n    `);\n    return stmt.run(\n      data.due_date,\n      data.interval,\n      data.ease_factor,\n      data.repetitions,\n      data.lapses,\n      data.state,\n      data.last_review,\n      id\n    );\n  },\n  \n  // Delete card\n  deleteCard(id) {\n    const stmt = db.prepare('DELETE FROM cards WHERE id = ?');\n    return stmt.run(id);\n  },\n  \n  // Get total count\n  getTotalCount() {\n    const stmt = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards');\n    return stmt.get().count;\n  },\n  \n  // Get due count\n  getDueCount() {\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n    const stmt = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE due_date <= ?');\n    return stmt.get(now).count;\n  },\n  \n  // Get reviewed count (has been reviewed at least once)\n  getReviewedCount() {\n    const stmt = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE repetitions > 0');\n    return stmt.get().count;\n  }\n};\n\nmodule.exports = Storage;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152728348}}
{"type":"message","id":"34965124","parentId":"601d7f3e","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:51.062Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在让我查看 scheduler.js 和 fsrs.js（当前简化版本）","thinkingSignature":"a077434676d99366ba580dd3a3f057682a9af4dc2192c028552875a58a33a92c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_npll10hbrlnb_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src/scheduler.js"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_npll10hbrlnb_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src/fsrs.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":8775,"output":93,"cacheRead":9100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17968,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772152728350}}
{"type":"message","id":"bda02f4d","parentId":"34965124","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:51.078Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_npll10hbrlnb_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// scheduler.js - Review scheduler using FSRS\nconst Storage = require('./storage');\nconst fsrs = require('./fsrs');\n\nconst Scheduler = {\n  // Check for due cards\n  checkDueCards() {\n    const cards = Storage.getDueCards();\n    return {\n      count: cards.length,\n      cards\n    };\n  },\n  \n  // Get next card for review\n  getNextCard() {\n    const cards = Storage.getDueCards();\n    return cards.length > 0 ? cards[0] : null;\n  },\n  \n  // Process a review rating\n  processReview(cardId, ratingValue) {\n    const card = Storage.getCard(cardId);\n    if (!card) {\n      return { error: 'Card not found' };\n    }\n    \n    // Map 1-5 to FSRS ratings (1-2 = Again/Hard, 3 = Good, 4-5 = Easy)\n    let rating;\n    if (ratingValue <= 2) {\n      rating = ratingValue === 1 ? fsrs.Rating.Again : fsrs.Rating.Hard;\n    } else {\n      rating = ratingValue === 3 ? fsrs.Rating.Good : fsrs.Rating.Easy;\n    }\n    \n    // Convert db card to FSRS card\n    const fsrsCard = fsrs.dbToCard(card);\n    \n    // Get scheduling result\n    const result = fsrs.repeat(fsrsCard, rating);\n    \n    // Update card in database\n    const now = new Date();\n    Storage.updateCard(cardId, {\n      due_date: result.due_date,\n      interval: result.interval,\n      ease_factor: result.ease_factor,\n      repetitions: result.repetitions,\n      lapses: result.lapses,\n      state: result.state,\n      last_review: now.toISOString()\n    });\n    \n    // Format next interval\n    let nextInterval;\n    if (result.interval < 1) {\n      nextInterval = `${Math.round(result.interval * 24)} 小时`;\n    } else if (result.interval < 30) {\n      nextInterval = `${Math.round(result.interval)} 天`;\n    } else if (result.interval < 365) {\n      nextInterval = `${Math.round(result.interval / 30)} 个月`;\n    } else {\n      nextInterval = `${Math.round(result.interval / 365)} 年`;\n    }\n    \n    return {\n      nextInterval,\n      interval: result.interval,\n      ease_factor: result.ease_factor\n    };\n  },\n  \n  // Get statistics\n  getStats() {\n    return {\n      total: Storage.getTotalCount(),\n      due: Storage.getDueCount(),\n      reviewed: Storage.getReviewedCount()\n    };\n  }\n};\n\nmodule.exports = Scheduler;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152731076}}
{"type":"message","id":"47d7cc73","parentId":"bda02f4d","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:51.084Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_npll10hbrlnb_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// fsrs.js - FSRS algorithm wrapper using fsrs.js npm package\nconst { FSRS, Card, Rating, State } = require('fsrs.js');\n\nclass FSRSEngine {\n  constructor() {\n    this.fsrs = new FSRS();\n  }\n  \n  // Get rating enum values\n  get Rating() {\n    return Rating;\n  }\n  \n  // Get state enum values\n  get State() {\n    return State;\n  }\n  \n  // Process a review and get scheduling info\n  repeat(card, rating) {\n    const now = new Date();\n    const result = this.fsrs.repeat(card, now);\n    \n    // Get the scheduling card for the given rating\n    // fsrs.js uses numeric ratings: 1=Again, 2=Hard, 3=Good, 4=Easy\n    const scheduling = result[rating];\n    \n    if (!scheduling) {\n      console.error('Scheduling not found for rating:', rating);\n      console.error('Available ratings:', Object.keys(result));\n      return null;\n    }\n    \n    // Calculate interval in days from due date\n    const dueDate = new Date(scheduling.card.due);\n    const intervalMs = dueDate - now;\n    const intervalDays = intervalMs / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24);\n    \n    return {\n      // Next review scheduling\n      due_date: scheduling.card.due.toISOString(),\n      interval: Math.max(0, intervalDays), // in days, minimum 0\n      ease_factor: scheduling.card.ease_factor,\n      repetitions: scheduling.card.reps,\n      lapses: scheduling.card.lapses,\n      state: scheduling.card.state,\n      stability: scheduling.card.stability,\n      difficulty: scheduling.card.difficulty,\n      \n      // Statistics from review log\n      scheduled_days: scheduling.review_log?.scheduled_days || 0,\n      elapsed_days: scheduling.review_log?.elapsed_days || 0,\n    };\n  }\n  \n  // Convert database card to FSRS card\n  dbToCard(dbCard) {\n    const card = new Card();\n    \n    // Set ease factor\n    card.ease_factor = dbCard.ease_factor || 2.5;\n    \n    // Set repetitions\n    card.reps = dbCard.repetitions || 0;\n    \n    // Set lapses\n    card.lapses = dbCard.lapses || 0;\n    \n    // If the card has been reviewed before (repetitions > 0), set state to Review\n    // Otherwise it's New\n    if (dbCard.repetitions > 0) {\n      card.state = State.Review;\n    } else {\n      card.state = State.New;\n    }\n    \n    // Calculate interval from due_date if it exists\n    if (dbCard.due_date) {\n      const dueDate = new Date(dbCard.due_date);\n      const now = new Date();\n      const intervalMs = dueDate - now;\n      card.interval = Math.max(0, intervalMs / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\n    }\n    \n    return card;\n  }\n  \n  // Convert FSRS card to db format\n  cardToDb(card) {\n    return {\n      due_date: card.due.toISOString(),\n      interval: card.interval,\n      ease_factor: card.ease_factor,\n      repetitions: card.reps,\n      lapses: card.lapses,\n      state: State[card.state].toLowerCase()\n    };\n  }\n}\n\nmodule.exports = new FSRSEngine();\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152731082}}
{"type":"message","id":"a01e6583","parentId":"47d7cc73","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:55.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我了解了项目的当前状态：\n\n1. **当前 FSRS 实现** - 已经引入了官方的 `fsrs.js` 库，scheduler.js 和 fsrs.js 已经在使用\n2. **数据结构** - 目前只有 cards 表，没有牌组概念\n3. **主题** - 还没有主题切换功能\n\n让我检查 Web UI 的 HTML 和 server.js：","thinkingSignature":"1f74041ea96a236fc9c9531ec9b5237627dbba964d403824bcbc1f285a4e5a78"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lb35bzyuwe79_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/index.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lb35bzyuwe79_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/server.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":10187,"output":154,"cacheRead":9100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19441,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772152731084}}
{"type":"message","id":"06ab279a","parentId":"a01e6583","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:55.374Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lb35bzyuwe79_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>FSRS Memory - 间隔重复学习</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\">\n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <span class=\"logo-icon\">🧠</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-text\">FSRS Memory</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n        <button class=\"nav-item active\" data-view=\"study\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📖</span>\n          <span>学习</span>\n          <span class=\"badge\" id=\"due-badge\">0</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"cards\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📚</span>\n          <span>卡片</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"add\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">➕</span>\n          <span>添加</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"stats\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📊</span>\n          <span>统计</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n      \n      <div class=\"sidebar-stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"total-cards\">0</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">总卡片</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"due-cards\">0</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">待复习</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n      <!-- Study View -->\n      <section id=\"study-view\" class=\"view active\">\n        <div class=\"study-header\">\n          <h1>今日复习</h1>\n          <div class=\"study-progress\">\n            <span id=\"study-progress\">0 / 0</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"study-container\" id=\"study-container\">\n          <!-- Card will be loaded here -->\n          <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"no-cards-message\">\n            <div class=\"empty-icon\">🎉</div>\n            <h2>太棒了！</h2>\n            <p>今天没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">添加新卡片</button>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"card-area\" id=\"card-area\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"card-header\">\n                <span class=\"card-id\">#<span id=\"card-id\">0</span></span>\n                <span class=\"card-state\" id=\"card-state\">new</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-front\" id=\"card-front\">\n                  <div class=\"card-label\">问题</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-text\" id=\"question-text\">加载中...</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-back\" id=\"card-back\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                  <div class=\"card-label\">答案</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-text\" id=\"answer-text\">加载中...</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-hint\" id=\"show-answer-btn\" onclick=\"showAnswer()\">显示答案</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"rating-buttons\" id=\"rating-buttons\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-again\" onclick=\"rateCard(1)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Again</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-1\">1m</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-hard\" onclick=\"rateCard(2)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Hard</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-2\">10m</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-good\" onclick=\"rateCard(3)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Good</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-3\">1d</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-easy\" onclick=\"rateCard(4)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Easy</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-4\">4d</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-perfect\" onclick=\"rateCard(5)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Perfect</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-5\">10d</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Cards List View -->\n      <section id=\"cards-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>所有卡片</h1>\n          <div class=\"search-box\">\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"card-search\" placeholder=\"搜索卡片...\" oninput=\"filterCards()\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"cards-list\" id=\"cards-list\">\n          <!-- Cards will be loaded here -->\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Add Card View -->\n      <section id=\"add-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>添加卡片</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"add-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"question-input\">问题</label>\n            <textarea id=\"question-input\" placeholder=\"输入问题...\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"answer-input\">答案</label>\n            <textarea id=\"answer-input\" placeholder=\"输入答案...\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large\" onclick=\"addCard()\">添加卡片</button>\n          \n          <div class=\"quick-add\">\n            <h3>快速添加 (格式: 问题::答案)</h3>\n            <textarea id=\"quick-add-input\" placeholder=\"每行一个卡片，格式: 问题::答案\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"quickAdd()\">批量添加</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Stats View -->\n      <section id=\"stats-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>学习统计</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">📚</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-total\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">总卡片数</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card stat-due\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">⏰</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-due\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">待复习</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card stat-done\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">✅</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-reviewed\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">已复习</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">🆕</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-new\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">新卡片</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">📈</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-learning\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">学习中</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">🎯</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-ease\">2.5</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">平均难度</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"stats-chart\">\n          <h3>学习进度</h3>\n          <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-new\" style=\"background: #3498db; width: 0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-learning\" style=\"background: #f39c12; width: 0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-review\" style=\"background: #27ae60; width: 0%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"progress-legend\">\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #3498db\"></span> 新卡片</span>\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #f39c12\"></span> 学习</span>\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #27ae60\"></span> 复习</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Delete Confirmation Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal\" id=\"delete-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <h3>确认删除</h3>\n      <p>确定要删除这张卡片吗？此操作无法撤销。</p>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-danger\" id=\"confirm-delete-btn\">删除</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Toast Notification -->\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\"></div>\n\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152735372}}
{"type":"message","id":"ee444f1f","parentId":"06ab279a","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:38:55.379Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lb35bzyuwe79_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// server.js - Express Backend for FSRS Web UI\nconst express = require('express');\nconst cors = require('cors');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst Database = require('better-sqlite3');\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3001;\n\n// Middleware\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, 'public')));\n\n// Database setup - connect to existing cards.db\nconst DB_PATH = process.env.DB_PATH || path.join(__dirname, '..', 'data', 'cards.db');\nconst db = new Database(DB_PATH);\n\n// ==================== API Routes ====================\n\n// Get all cards\napp.get('/api/cards', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const cards = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards ORDER BY created_at DESC').all();\n    res.json({ success: true, data: cards });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get due cards for review\napp.get('/api/cards/due', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n    const cards = db.prepare(`\n      SELECT * FROM cards \n      WHERE due_date <= ? \n      ORDER BY due_date ASC\n    `).all(now);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: cards });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get single card\napp.get('/api/cards/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const card = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    if (!card) {\n      return res.status(404).json({ success: false, error: 'Card not found' });\n    }\n    res.json({ success: true, data: card });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Add new card\napp.post('/api/cards', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { question, answer } = req.body;\n    if (!question || !answer) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Question and answer required' });\n    }\n    \n    const now = new Date();\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      INSERT INTO cards (question, answer, due_date, created_at)\n      VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)\n    `);\n    const result = stmt.run(question, answer, now.toISOString(), now.toISOString());\n    \n    const newCard = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(result.lastInsertRowid);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: newCard });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Update card (after review)\napp.put('/api/cards/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { due_date, interval, ease_factor, repetitions, lapses, state, last_review } = req.body;\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      UPDATE cards SET\n        due_date = ?,\n        interval = ?,\n        ease_factor = ?,\n        repetitions = ?,\n        lapses = ?,\n        state = ?,\n        last_review = ?\n      WHERE id = ?\n    `);\n    stmt.run(due_date, interval, ease_factor, repetitions, lapses, state, last_review, req.params.id);\n    \n    const updatedCard = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: updatedCard });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Delete card\napp.delete('/api/cards/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    db.prepare('DELETE FROM cards WHERE id = ?').run(req.params.id);\n    res.json({ success: true });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get statistics\napp.get('/api/stats', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const total = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards').get().count;\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n    const due = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE due_date <= ?').get(now).count;\n    const reviewed = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE repetitions > 0').get().count;\n    const newCards = db.prepare(\"SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE state = 'new'\").get().count;\n    const learning = db.prepare(\"SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE state = 'learning'\").get().count;\n    const review = db.prepare(\"SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE state = 'review'\").get().count;\n    \n    // Calculate average ease factor\n    const avgEase = db.prepare('SELECT AVG(ease_factor) as avg FROM cards WHERE repetitions > 0').get().avg || 2.5;\n    \n    res.json({\n      success: true,\n      data: {\n        total,\n        due,\n        reviewed,\n        new: newCards,\n        learning,\n        review,\n        avgEase: Math.round(avgEase * 100) / 100\n      }\n    });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Review card with FSRS rating\napp.post('/api/review/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { rating } = req.body; // 1-5\n    if (!rating || rating < 1 || rating > 5) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Rating must be 1-5' });\n    }\n    \n    const card = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    if (!card) {\n      return res.status(404).json({ success: false, error: 'Card not found' });\n    }\n    \n    // FSRS algorithm calculation\n    const result = calculateFSRS(card, rating);\n    \n    // Update card\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      UPDATE cards SET\n        due_date = ?,\n        interval = ?,\n        ease_factor = ?,\n        repetitions = ?,\n        lapses = ?,\n        state = ?,\n        last_review = ?\n      WHERE id = ?\n    `);\n    stmt.run(\n      result.due_date,\n      result.interval,\n      result.ease_factor,\n      result.repetitions,\n      result.lapses,\n      result.state,\n      new Date().toISOString(),\n      req.params.id\n    );\n    \n    const updatedCard = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: updatedCard, nextInterval: result.interval });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Simple FSRS calculation (based on fsrs.js logic)\nfunction calculateFSRS(card, rating) {\n  let { interval, ease_factor, repetitions, lapses, state } = card;\n  \n  // Rating mapping: 1=Again, 2=Hard, 3=Good, 4=Easy, 5=Perfect\n  const now = new Date();\n  \n  if (rating === 1) {\n    // Again - reset\n    interval = 1;\n    ease_factor = Math.max(1.3, ease_factor - 0.2);\n    repetitions = 0;\n    lapses += 1;\n    state = 'learning';\n  } else if (rating === 2) {\n    // Hard\n    interval = Math.max(1, Math.round(interval * 1.2));\n    ease_factor = Math.max(1.3, ease_factor - 0.15);\n    state = repetitions === 0 ? 'learning' : 'review';\n  } else if (rating === 3) {\n    // Good\n    if (repetitions === 0) {\n      interval = 1;\n    } else if (repetitions === 1) {\n      interval = 6;\n    } else {\n      interval = Math.round(interval * ease_factor);\n    }\n    repetitions += 1;\n    state = 'review';\n  } else if (rating === 4) {\n    // Easy\n    if (repetitions === 0) {\n      interval = 4;\n    } else {\n      interval = Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.3);\n    }\n    ease_factor += 0.15;\n    repetitions += 1;\n    state = 'review';\n  } else if (rating === 5) {\n    // Perfect\n    if (repetitions === 0) {\n      interval = 10;\n    } else {\n      interval = Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.5);\n    }\n    ease_factor += 0.2;\n    repetitions += 1;\n    state = 'review';\n  }\n  \n  // Calculate next due date\n  const dueDate = new Date(now.getTime() + interval * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n  \n  return {\n    due_date: dueDate.toISOString(),\n    interval,\n    ease_factor: Math.round(ease_factor * 100) / 100,\n    repetitions,\n    lapses,\n    state\n  };\n}\n\n// Serve SPA for all other routes\napp.get('*', (req, res) => {\n  res.sendFile(path.join(__dirname, 'public', 'index.html'));\n});\n\n// Start server\napp.listen(PORT, () => {\n  console.log(`FSRS Web UI server running on http://localhost:${PORT}`);\n});\n\nmodule.exports = app;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772152735377}}
{"type":"message","id":"4088ca0c","parentId":"ee444f1f","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:39:04.173Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我对项目有了全面的了解。让我整理一下需要做的优化：\n\n1. **完整 FSRS 算法** - 看起来已经引入了 fsrs.js 库（package.json 中有），但是 server.js 使用的是简化版算法，而不是真正的 fsrs.js 库。storage.js 和 scheduler.js 使用了 fsrs.js，但 server.js 没有。我需要统一使用 fsrs.js 库。\n\n2. **多牌组管理** - 当前没有 decks 表，需要创建新的表结构来支持多牌组\n\n3. **主题切换** - 需要添加亮色/暗色主题支持，并持久化保存\n\n让我规划 DAG 任务：\n\n- **并行任务 1**: 数据迁移 - 添加 decks 表\n- **并行任务 2**: Web UI 主题功能 \n- **并行任务 3**: 统一使用 fsrs.js 库\n\n等等，实际上：\n1. 完整 FSRS 算法 - server.js 还在使用简化版算法，需要改为使用 fsrs.js 库\n2. 多牌组管理 - 需要添加 decks 表，修改 storage.js, server.js 和前端\n3. 主题切换 - 前端需要支持\n\n我需要：\n- code-agent 来实现代码变更\n- review-agent 来审查代码\n\n让我使用 DAG 模式组织任务：\n- Level 1: 数据迁移（deck 表）- 可以并行\n\n\n- Level 2: 核心功能实现（FSRS 算法统一、多牌组管理、主题）\n- Level 3: 测试与审查\n\n让我先调用 code-agent 来实现这些任务。","thinkingSignature":"bc367f566fd36a8fb325bc0beef247a488d8854ab1bbdc824e4187cc8d971547"},{"type":"text","text":"现在我了解了项目状态。让我总结需要完成的优化：\n\n**当前状态：**\n1. ✅ 已安装 `fsrs.js` 库（package.json），但 server.js 使用简化算法\n2. ❌ 无多牌组支持（只有 cards 表）\n3. ❌ 无主题切换功能\n\n**任务规划（DAG 模式）：**\n- **并行 Level 1**: 数据库迁移（添加 decks 表）、主题基础架构\n- **并行 Level 2**: 核心功能（FSRS 算法、多牌组 CRUD、主题 UI）\n- **Level 3**: 测试与审查\n\n让我启动 code-agent 来实现这些优化：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5mxs2ijv0bmw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/.openclaw/agents && ls -la | grep -E \"code-agent|test-agent|review-agent\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":14753,"output":496,"cacheRead":9100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24349,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772152735379}}
